  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67e51474f21856e1",
      "translationZh": "Aritra 来自 Hugging Face。我想向大家更新关于 `transformers` 的最新变化。我们现在原生支持 GGUFs (llama cpp quants)。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05e98c5e4fd36fec",
      "translationZh": "加载后，你正在使用常规的 Transformers API。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9af3d65e776a7dc6",
      "translationZh": "我们为什么要这样做？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b9594073f965ff33",
      "translationZh": "量化模型体积更小（因此可以适配笔记本电脑）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1bb97c51313c8c0e",
      "translationZh": "手头的 PyTorch 工具（对调试很有用）",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22965ea8ff42c533",
      "translationZh": "调试、评估和自定义生成变得更加容易",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8c1734979e3a7de",
      "translationZh": "在受支持的 Apple Silicon 配置上，我们还在复用 ggml 内核，因此模型可以直接从其打包的量化权重中运行。在我们在 M2 Max 上测试的 Qwen 检查点中，Transformers 达到了：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5286712c4b992ce",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.5-4B Q4_K_M：70.4 tok/s 对比使用 llama.cpp 时的 71.8 tok/s",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ef6c78fcaadc800",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.8-27B UD-Q4_K_M: 15.9 tok/s 对比 13.4 tok/s",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "26ea6da691c86bde",
      "translationZh": "Qwen3.5-35B-A3B UD-IQ4_XS: 60.2 tok/s 对比 61.3 tok/s",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96df6ba6b23d6b3b",
      "translationZh": "这并不是为了取代 llama.cpp。如果你只关心最大的本地推理性能，llama.cpp 可能仍然是更好的选择。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13b9091ef549337d",
      "translationZh": "重点更多在于你现在可以在更灵活的环境中使用相同的 GGUF 模型。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "225e54ef61a2abfb",
      "translationZh": "阅读更多：https://huggingface.co/blog/transformers-llama-cpp-quants",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
